    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d826">

                <pb facs="0888" n="878" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg878"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Executive Secretariat Files: NSC 41 Folder</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Secretary of State of a Conversation
                        With President Truman</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1949-09-16">September 16, 1949</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>This morning at the Cabinet meeting the President had in his hand a copy of NSC
                    41 which was the paper approved last February on trade with China. The President
                    said he thought it was out of date and should be revised. I assured him that the
                    matter would be looked into at once.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>D[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ean</hi>] A[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >cheson</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
